    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d842">

                <pb facs="0819" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg721"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Baron
                            Fava.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 574.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of the 2d instant in regard to the lynching of certain
                    persons of Italian origin at Tallulah, La.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to inclose a copy of a letter addressed to the governor
                    of Louisiana on the 29th ultimo by the district attorney of the ninth judicial
                    district of Louisiana, reporting that the third grand jury has investigated the
                    affair, without finding evidence to implicate anyone.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">David J. Hill</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d842-a1.xml" xpointer="d842-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
